{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415662","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415662","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041566201:1":{"text":"真巧，这不是替霍根将军暂时代管骑士团日常事务的维伦先生吗。","source_cn":"真巧，这不是替霍根将军暂时代管骑士团日常事务的维伦先生吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8DAEEC6E019A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566202:1":{"text":"确实，尽管我挺想反驳你那漫长的前缀的。","source_cn":"确实，尽管我挺想反驳你那漫长的前缀的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F0C7E1273B0BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566203:1":{"text":"如果能选的话，我倒是更愿意一直留在这酒馆里，愉快地喝上一杯。","source_cn":"如果能选的话，我倒是更愿意一直留在这酒馆里，愉快地喝上一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06D37569555E379E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566204:1":{"text":"——捎带一提，见到你很荣幸，伊芙小姐。","source_cn":"——捎带一提，见到你很荣幸，伊芙小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C39AF6730C3E0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566205:1":{"text":"这好像不适合作为寒暄的开场白啊。","source_cn":"这好像不适合作为寒暄的开场白啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35549BBE45618CA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566206:1":{"text":"毕竟目前为止，我们也没有寒暄的必要。","source_cn":"毕竟目前为止，我们也没有寒暄的必要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4053E52A64D39FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566207:1":{"text":"那我们是不是也没有像这样互相试探的必要呢？","source_cn":"那我们是不是也没有像这样互相试探的必要呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7935D734870F185","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566208:1":{"text":"当然有，小姐。在您的那位大人尚未直接对我揭开她——或者他尊贵的面纱前，我总得保持相应的礼貌。","source_cn":"当然有，小姐。在您的那位大人尚未直接对我揭开她——或者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53DB873A88560B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566209:1":{"text":"所以，你在把刺探和绕弯子作为礼貌？","source_cn":"所以，你在把刺探和绕弯子作为礼貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBCB7F388C798FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566210:1":{"text":"比起确切不移的判断和大言不惭的谎言来说，这足够礼貌了，小姐。","source_cn":"比起确切不移的判断和大言不惭的谎言来说，这足够礼貌了，小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF027924FFCA498C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566211:1":{"text":"至少，我没有装作一无所知，伪装成一个浪荡子，说些浪费时间的废话。","source_cn":"至少，我没有装作一无所